{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Banner of Conquest&quot; is a Three Kingdoms-themed Survivor-like (Bullet Heaven) game.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, historical legends transform into <strong>OP stat monsters</strong>. Your goal is simple: Survive the wave, get rich, and become unstoppably strong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/15c3989c762b9f0f8d7d14ac7f256d59.poster.avif?t=1764647961\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/15c3989c762b9f0f8d7d14ac7f256d59.webm?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/15c3989c762b9f0f8d7d14ac7f256d59.mp4?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/02d0879ddebd5a4594ba0008c3a704e9.avif?t=1764647961\" width=600 height=140 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break the Game with 20+ Unique Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Zhao Yun, Lu Bu, Guan Yu, and more. Each character brings a unique, rule-breaking mechanic to the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to experience a Broken Build? Choose Emperor Xian. His unique trait allowing you to grab everything in the shop for <strong>ZERO GOLD</strong>. Experience the joy of scaling your stats to infinity for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/9afe98eb958645061430cf8c040bdfb2.poster.avif?t=1764647961\" width=802 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/9afe98eb958645061430cf8c040bdfb2.webm?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/9afe98eb958645061430cf8c040bdfb2.mp4?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve from Scrap Iron to legendary weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of weapons with 100+ Stratagem Cards to create your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special weapon crafting system allows even simple blades to be upgraded into legendary weapons with immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/9cc1e913a20f2a25cd006c0c5724e5e9.poster.avif?t=1764647961\" width=802 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/9cc1e913a20f2a25cd006c0c5724e5e9.webm?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/9cc1e913a20f2a25cd006c0c5724e5e9.mp4?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shop, Build, Survive (Brotato Style)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mindless killing isn't enough; you need a strategy. The game features a classic Wave + Shop cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between enemy waves, use your gold wisely. Reroll the shop to find that one specific Stratagem Card or Weapon to complete your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Mounts, Stratagems, and Hero Traits to craft your ultimate build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/16a0f4b272723f8120808fb0b48057d8.poster.avif?t=1764647961\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/16a0f4b272723f8120808fb0b48057d8.webm?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/16a0f4b272723f8120808fb0b48057d8.mp4?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the battlefield, slay the generals, and conquer the chaos!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"My Coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/555b839cf91ee043b30d9faf303af70114053847.jpg"},{"name":"My Treasury","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/b1164eeb5558643c526170f31d61a703276266d8.jpg"},{"name":"Prosperous Year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/ab876c918ebe7a21ea16a9e735861f1f6fb4c347.jpg"},{"name":"Prosperous Era","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/c1904c97ff82089009b102aa676ffaf555a215a3.jpg"},{"name":"What's in here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/203fc9f53caab107dbf832ab89e229118fbc9595.jpg"},{"name":"My precious!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/b50b0a5434f08974ba06a02675363a9d269b08bd.jpg"},{"name":"There's always one that doesn't suit you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/699446d7ca84a2b0d1215d1a93d37a54f920b92a.jpg"},{"name":"What's in this filling?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2483730/02fea0c68f5cb07f8d6fc664a00f