ns with immense power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/9cc1e913a20f2a25cd006c0c5724e5e9.poster.avif?t=1764647961\" width=802 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/9cc1e913a20f2a25cd006c0c5724e5e9.webm?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/9cc1e913a20f2a25cd006c0c5724e5e9.mp4?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shop, Build, Survive (Brotato Style)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mindless killing isn't enough; you need a strategy. The game features a classic Wave + Shop cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between enemy waves, use your gold wisely. Reroll the shop to find that one specific Stratagem Card or Weapon to complete your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Mounts, Stratagems, and Hero Traits to craft your ultimate build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/16a0f4b272723f8120808fb0b48057d8.poster.avif?t=1764647961\" width=800 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/16a0f4b272723f8120808fb0b48057d8.webm?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483730/extras/16a0f4b272723f8120808fb0b48057d8.mp4?t=1764647961\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step onto the battlefield, slay the generals, and conquer the chaos!</p>","developers":["Haojoy Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Ac